{
  "uid": "evo-alerts",
  "title": "Alerts",
  "description": "What the stack is complaining about right now, how long it has been complaining, and whether the alerting pipeline is still delivering. Rules fire in Prometheus and are delivered by Alertmanager; this page reads both off the Prometheus datasource, which is registered alerting: true.",
  "tags": ["evo-t1", "alerts"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "EVO-T1 stack",
      "url": "/d/evo-home/evo-t1-stack",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "asDashboard": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "tags": []
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Firing now",
      "id": 1,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this page",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 20, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Rules live in `observability/prometheus/rules/`, fire in Prometheus, and are delivered by Alertmanager. Every panel here reads the native `ALERTS` / `ALERTS_FOR_STATE` series off the Prometheus datasource, which is registered `alerting: true`, so this page and Prometheus's own `/alerts` view cannot disagree. **Silences are made in Alertmanager's own UI, not in Grafana**: it is bound to loopback on the stack host at `http://127.0.0.1:9093` by design, and it is the single place that holds silences, grouping, and repeat intervals. Alerts a person creates in the Grafana UI are not a second pipeline: the provisioned contact point `stack-alertmanager` is of type `alertmanager`, so they are POSTed to that same Alertmanager and get the same grouping, inhibition, and silences as a Prometheus one."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alertmanager",
      "description": "Where silences belong: Alertmanager binds loopback on the stack host, and Grafana-originated alerts ride the provisioned `stack-alertmanager` contact point (type `alertmanager`) to this same service, so one place holds the silences for both engines.",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Silences are made in Alertmanager.** Its UI binds loopback on the stack host at the port `OBS_ALERTMANAGER_PORT` names (9093), because that UI can silence a firing alert. Read it from a shell there, or tunnel the port."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Firing alerts",
      "description": "One row per alert Prometheus holds in state firing. ALERTS carries alertstate while ALERTS_FOR_STATE carries the same labels without it, so the second query is filtered through ALERTS and joined on alertname; the since column is the time that alert first entered firing, which is what separates a new break from a known nuisance.",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "ALERTS_FOR_STATE and on (alertname) ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "joinByField", "options": { "byField": "alertname", "mode": "outer" } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Value #A": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "__name__ 1": true,
              "__name__ 2": true,
              "alertstate": true,
              "alertstate 1": true,
              "alertstate 2": true,
              "job": true,
              "job 1": true,
              "job 2": true,
              "rule": true,
              "rule 1": true,
              "rule 2": true,
              "rule_group": true,
              "rule_group 1": true,
              "rule_group 2": true,
              "severity 1": true,
              "severity 2": true,
              "tier 1": true,
              "tier 2": true,
              "spark 1": true,
              "spark 2": true,
              "instance 1": true,
              "instance 2": true,
              "hostname 1": true,
              "hostname 2": true
            },
            "renameByName": { "Value #B": "firing since" }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "convertFieldType",
          "options": { "conversions": [ { "targetField": "firing since", "destinationType": "time" } ] }
        },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "sort": [ { "field": "severity", "desc": false } ] } }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "filterable": true }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "firing since" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "dateTimeAsIso" },
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 190 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "severity" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "id": "severity",
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "critical": { "text": "critical", "color": "red" },
                      "warning": { "text": "warning", "color": "orange" },
                      "info": { "text": "info", "color": "blue" }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Critical firing",
      "description": "severity=critical is the level the provisioned policy repeats every 15m, so anything above 0 here is something a person should be acting on rather than watching.",
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\",severity=\"critical\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Warning firing",
      "description": "severity=warning: the level that says something is degrading rather than broken, such as a filesystem filling or a rule group taking too long to evaluate.",
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\",severity=\"warning\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Info firing",
      "description": "severity=info, kept so a page written against the three levels does not go blind if an operator adds one; no rule under observability/prometheus/rules/ ships at this level today, so 0 is the expected reading.",
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 11 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\",severity=\"info\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "blue", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Alert volume",
      "id": 8,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Firing series by alert",
      "description": "How many separate series each alertname is firing, so an alert that fans out across every Spark is visible as a wide band rather than a single line that looks calm.",
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 12, "lineWidth": 1, "stacking": { "mode": "none" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count by (alertname) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alertmanager intake",
      "description": "Alerts per second Alertmanager has accepted, beside what it is holding. Intake climbing while the held line stays flat means alerts are arriving and resolving quickly, which is a flapping rule rather than an outage.",
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(alertmanager_alerts_received_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "received/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (state) (alertmanager_alerts)",
          "legendFormat": "held {{state}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Alerting health",
      "id": 11,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Notifications dropped",
      "description": "Alerts Prometheus gave up on sending. Anything above 0 means alerts are being discarded rather than delayed, and the stack is quietly deaf.",
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(prometheus_notifications_dropped_total)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Rules loaded",
      "description": "Recording and alerting rules Prometheus has loaded from observability/prometheus/rules/. A number that drops after a deploy means a rule file stopped parsing and the old set is still in memory.",
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(prometheus_rule_group_rules)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Held by Alertmanager",
      "description": "Alerts Alertmanager is holding across all states, which includes the ones silenced, so read this beside the firing count above rather than instead of it.",
      "id": 14,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(alertmanager_alerts)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Slowest rule group",
      "description": "The longest single rule-group evaluation, against the 15s evaluation_interval in observability/prometheus/prometheus.yml: once a group approaches that interval it runs back to back and alerts fire late.",
      "id": 15,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(prometheus_rule_group_last_duration_seconds)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "noValue": "n/a", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 7 }, { "color": "red", "value": 15 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rule group evaluation time",
      "description": "Per-group evaluation time, one line per group. The group whose line sits highest is the rule file that has outgrown its interval, and splitting it is cheaper than raising the interval for everything.",
      "id": 16,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "min": 0, "unit": "s", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "prometheus_rule_group_last_duration_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{rule_group}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
